      "title_sha256_16": "08fc182f078a0c27",
      "title_text": "'Indirect Expenses' lines netting to nil on vouchers with a party ledger: nothing to attribute",
      "limits_sha256_16": "0bbe43dac67333a8",
      "limits_text": [
        "On each voucher cited (none of them a sales, purchase, credit or debit note voucher) a party ledger is present, but the 'Indirect Expenses' lines net to nil, so they move no net amount on these ledgers and are on neither side. The vouchers are counted in the row 'Not attributed to a party' and add nothing to its amounts."
